flexbox-playground.formula:
.container {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: <row | column | ...>;
  justify-content: <main-axis>;
  align-items: <cross-axis>;
  flex-wrap: <nowrap | wrap>;
  gap: <N>px;
}
.item-N {
  align-self: <override>;
  flex-grow: <N>;
}

flexbox-playground.workedExample:
Set flex-direction row, justify-content center, align-items center, flex-wrap wrap, gap 16 px, 4 items. Select item 3 with align-self flex-start and flex-grow 1.

Generated CSS:
.container {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: row;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 16px;
}

.item-3 {
  align-self: flex-start;
  flex-grow: 1;
}

Items 1, 2, and 4 stay centered while item 3 stretches to the top and grows to take free space.
